{
  "description": "Shared query set and relevance judgments. Read by eval_search.py (Distill-only, per-leg attribution) and run_eval.py (Distill vs TwelveLabs arms). queries[] uses eval_search.py's schema; k_values/defaults/arms are additions that eval_search.py ignores.",
